Meta.documentation:Data.get
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Reads a field out of a Data value, typed.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The URI is a dotted path: Data.get:headers.host digs .headers.host out of each
Meta.documentation:incoming value and emits it on the output matching its type (out_String_default for
Meta.documentation:strings, out_Number_default, out_Boolean_default, out_Data_default for the rest).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Data_default_$all - each value to dig into
Meta.documentation:@port in_request_headers_$all - request meta alias (httpServer)
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default - string field values
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number_default - number field values
Meta.documentation:@port out_Boolean_default - boolean field values
Meta.documentation:@port out_Data_default - object/array field values
Meta.documentation:@see match
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

